---
import "../styles/palette.css";
import LinkLayout from "./LinkLayout.astro";
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="factsheet">
            <div>
                <h4>From early on as a kid...</h4><p>
                    I enjoyed programming. My first contact with a programming
                    language was <span id="blue"><b>Lua</b></span>, as I used it
                    to make custom levels for a mobile game called <LinkLayout
                        id="pinky"
                        href="https://pewpew.live/"
                        >Pewpew
                    </LinkLayout><span> </span>
                    <LinkLayout id="cyan" href="https://pewpew.live/">
                        Live</LinkLayout
                    >. Playing my first level after finally finishing it was a
                    moment of <i>pure joy</i>. That
                    <span id="fire"> spark</span> of creativity planted a seed.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h4>As time went on...</h4>
                <p>
                    the hobby kept going and the seed kept growing as I got
                    interested in <span id="cyan">game development</span>.
                    Trying to make games with <span id="lightgrey">Unity</span>,
                    I learned <span id="green">C#</span> and <span id="cyan"
                        >music composition</span
                    >. That being said, I failed a lot, but each time I learned
                    more and more and I came to learn how to utilize my failures
                    to bring success.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h4>Growing and evolving...</h4>
                <p>
                    I got interested in software engineering in general. With a
                    couple of friends, we gathered as a team, the <span id="red"
                        >H</span
                    ><span id="pinky">y</span><span id="fire">b</span><span
                        >r</span
                    ><span id="cyan">o</span><span id="green">id</span>
                    <span id="white"> Team</span>, and made a domain-specific
                    programming language called <LinkLayout
                        href="https://github.com/pewpewlive/hybroid-live"
                        ><span id="red">H</span><span id="pinky">y</span><span
                            id="fire">b</span
                        ><span>r</span><span id="cyan">o</span><span id="green"
                            >id</span
                        ></LinkLayout
                    >, which turned out very well. After that and a couple of
                    small projects, we come to today. At this point in time I'm
                    building my own game engine called
                    <span id="greyed"> universe</span>, it's open source!
                </p>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h4>But that's not all!</h4>
                <p>
                    Throughout the course of this long-lasting programming
                    excursion, I've also started and ended many hobbies. There
                    <i> were</i> a few that stuck around though. <span
                        id="pinky">Pixel art</span
                    > was and still is an important hobby for me, with my first drawing
                    being <span id="cyan">7 years ago</span>. Playing video
                    games is also something I'll never get bored of, simply
                    because it's a fun activity with friends and it <span
                        id="fire"><i>inspires</i></span
                    > me.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h4>
                    <span id="pinky"
                        >If you've read up to this point, thank you and have a
                        great day!</span
                    >
                </h4>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

<style>
    .container {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
    }
    .factsheet {
        background-color: var(--bg-2-color);
        display: grid;
        border-radius: 14px;
        border: 2px solid transparent;
        border-color: deeppink;
        box-shadow: rgb(120, 0, 50) 0 0 15px;
        margin-top: 1em;
    }

    .factsheet div {
        text-align: center;
        margin: 0em 1.8em;
    }
    .factsheet div h4 {
        font-size: 1.14em;
        color: cyan;
        text-shadow: rgb(0, 100, 180) 0 0 17px;
    }
    .factsheet div p,
    a {
        font-size: 1.1em;
        color: rgb(110, 160, 230);
    }

    @media only screen and (max-width: 1000px) {
        /* mobile */
        .factsheet {
            width: 90vw;
        }
    }

    @media only screen and (min-width: 1000px) {
        /* desktop */
        .factsheet {
            width: 60%;
        }
    }
</style>
